# UAT/staging build: B2B is served at the domain root (uat.legaldesk.com/),
# and nginx proxies /api/ to the UAT backend — same-origin, avoiding CORS.
# Must be the full absolute origin, NOT "/api" or empty: every apiRequest()
# call already includes the "/api" prefix itself (see src/lib/api.js), and
# api.js's `VITE_API_BASE_URL || "http://127.0.0.1:8000"` fallback means an
# empty string here silently gets replaced by that localhost default at
# build time (empty string is falsy in JS) rather than staying empty.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://uat.legaldesk.com
